{"id":"vmcore-dmesg.8","n":"vmcore-dmesg","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"kexec-tools","ver":"2.0.29-5.el9_6.2","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/k/kexec-tools-2.0.29-5.el9_6.2.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/vmcore-dmesg.8.gz","sha256":"55563e9ca1c8bbf482fc112dc7bdb9f34fcfd5279d2947c72e604b20d5165d18","date":"September 21, 2020","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"kexec-tools","ver":"1:2.0.22-2ubuntu2.22.04.2","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/k/kexec-tools/kexec-tools_2.0.22-2ubuntu2.22.04.2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/vmcore-dmesg.8.gz","sha256":"288cb6c8b47589708b1c14deb8734a2ba03626abfb9d153c0784f6ac48d15f0b","date":"September 21, 2020","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"extract the dmesg from a vmcore","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>vmcore-dmesg</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>vmcore-dmesg</b> vmcore</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>vmcore-dmesg</b> extracts the dmesg from a vmcore and write it to standard out. <b>vmcore-dmesg</b> works against either <b>/proc/vmcore</b> in a crash dump capture context or a copy of <b>/proc/vmcore</b> that has been saved for later analysis. A single build of <b>vmcore-dmesg</b> should work against any linux vmcore written created on any architecture.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>kexec(8)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>vmcore-dmesg was written by Eric Biederman.</p>"]],"u":[["NAME","<p>vmcore-dmesg - extract the dmesg from a vmcore</p>"],["SYNOPSIS",1],["DESCRIPTION",2],["SEE ALSO",3],["AUTHOR",4]],"diff":{"r":[],"u":[]}}